    {
      "command": "arrival_narrative",
      "error": null,
      "receipt": null,
      "events": [],
      "shocks": [],
      "notes": [
        "[bold]You arrive at Porto Novo.[/bold]",
        "",
        "The port appears through a golden haze \u2014 sun-warmed stone, terracotta roofs, and the sound of harbor life carrying across calm water. Spring arrivals in the Mediterranean feel like coming home, even when you've never been here before.",
        "",
        "Grain barges jostle for position along the stone quays. Clerks with wax tablets tally every bushel while porters sweat under heavy sacks.",
        "",
        "[bold]Vasco da Reira:[/bold] \"Manifest and tonnage, Captain. I'll assign your berth once I've reviewed them.\"",
        "[bold]Marta Soares:[/bold] \"You're here for the rates? They were posted at dawn. Grain is steady, spice is climbing. What are you buying?\"",
        "",
        "[dim]Landmark: The Grain Exchange \u2014 a columned hall where prices are read aloud at dawn.[/dim]",
        "[dim]Custom: Captains ring the harbor bell on first arrival. It's bad luck not to.[/dim]"
      ]
    },
