        {
          "event_type": "nothing",
          "message": "[bold]You arrive at Silva Bay.[/bold]\n\nThe port appears through a golden haze \u2014 sun-warmed stone, terracotta roofs, and the sound of harbor life carrying across calm water. Spring arrivals in the Mediterranean feel like coming home, even when you've never been here before.\n\nSawdust drifts like snow across the waterfront. Half-finished hulls rise on slipways, their ribs exposed like the skeletons of great fish.\n\n[bold]Nuno Ferreira:[/bold] \"Berth's over there. Tie up properly \u2014 I don't want you drifting into the slipways. Timber loading happens at dawn, so don't sleep late.\"\n\n[dim]Landmark: The Master Shipyard \u2014 where the finest hulls in the Mediterranean take shape.[/dim]\n[dim]Custom: Touching another captain's ship without permission is grounds for a duel.[/dim]",
